@host = http://localhost:5055

### get method payment
GET {{host}}/api/v1/paymentMethods

### info wallet
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/5

### post new user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "kevin",
	"fullName": "Kevin",
	"email": "kevin@mail.com",
	"phone": "081200000011"
}

### post a duplicate user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "kevin",
	"fullName": "Kevin Lagi",
	"email": "kevin2@mail.com",
	"phone": "081200000099"
}

### post request top up
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/5/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"amount": 50000,
	"paymentMethodCode": "BANK_TRANSFER",
	"description": "Top up uji"
}

### get check balance before confirm
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/5

### post confirm top up
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/5/confirm

### post confirm double 
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/5/confirm

### post transfer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL002",
	"amount": 50000,
	"description": "Uji transfer"
}

### post amount < balance (rollback)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL002",
	"amount": 999000000,
	"description": "Terlalu besar"
}

### post transfer not found wallet
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL999",
	"amount": 10000
}

### post transfer on his own wallet
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL001",
	"amount": 10000
}

### get history transaction pagination
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/5/transactions?page=1&pageSize=5

### get history transaction filter search sorting
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/transactions?type=TRANSFER&status=SUCCESS&direction=OUT&search=TRF&sortBy=amount&sortDir=asc&dateFrom=2026-11-01&dateTo=2026-12-31

### get history mutation user in and out
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/mutations?page=1&pageSize=10

### get history mutation only IN
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/5/mutations?direction=IN&sortBy=createdAt&sortDir=desc

### get pagination invalid (400)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/transactions?page=0&pageSize=500

### get new auditlogs
GET {{host}}/api/v1/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20

### first topup request
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/5/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1000, "paymentMethodCode": "QRIS" }

### second topup request
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/5/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 2000, "paymentMethodCode": "QRIS" }

### confirm with delay (C)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/5/confirm?delayMs=10000

### confirm without delay -> success 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/5/confirm

### result C: 409 Conflict 
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/5/transactions?type=TOPUP
